<item>
<title>姆巴佩因“辱毛”被封杀 品牌解约账号遭禁言央视：皇马难辞其咎法国球星姆巴佩一段采访近日在中国流传后遭封杀。他称最令他发笑</title>
<link>https://t.me/OutsightChina/10420</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/OutsightChina/10420</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 05:00:30 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"><b>姆巴佩因“辱毛”被封杀</b> <b>品牌解约账号遭禁言<br/>央视：皇马难辞其咎</b><br/><br/>法国球星姆巴佩一段采访近日在中国流传后遭封杀。他称最令他发笑的表情包是一个把他的脸放到“中国独裁者”（即毛泽东）头上的表情包，但他未点名毛泽东。视频流传后随即在中国网络上引起轩然大波。央视宣布停播西甲赛事，东鹏、蒙牛等品牌纷纷与姆巴佩解约，其国内社媒账号被禁言。<br/><br/>外交部回应称，伤害中国人民感情的言行自然会遭共同抵制。姆巴佩27日在X发声明道歉，称言论“欠妥”。但央视还要求姆巴佩所属的皇马也必须为此道歉，否则“一切免谈”。直到28日，皇马亦为此公开道歉。<br/><br/>有台媒称，讽刺的是官媒仅以“不当涉华言论”带过，许多网民不知他说了什么。美国众议院中共问题特别委员会则称，他不应为称毛泽东为独裁者道歉。<br/><br/><a href="?q=%23%E4%BD%93%E8%82%B2">#体育</a> <a href="?q=%23%E8%B6%B3%E7%90%83">#足球</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5">#审查</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%B7%B2404">#已404</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%9C%8B%E9%89%B4">#看鉴</a><br/><br/><i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png')"><b>🔗</b></i>原文链接<br/>《自由亚洲电台》<a href="https://www.rfa.org/mandarin/shehui/2026/10/28/china-mbappe-mao-zedong-football-patriotism/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">姆巴佩称毛泽东独裁者 中国举国声讨</a><br/>《中国外交部》<a href="https://ipc.fmprc.gov.cn/chn/fyrth/202610/t20261027_12047706.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">2026年10月27日外交部发言人郭嘉昆主持例行记者会</a><br/>《央视新闻》<a href="https://news.cctv.com/2026/10/28/ARTIDfj5ucNrQxlxEyLjcR3l261028.shtml" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">总台体育青少中心发言人：不认可皇马的表态</a><br/>《Real Madrid C. F.》<a href="https://www.realmadrid.com/en-US/news/club/announcements/comunicado-oficial-28-10-2026" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">Official Statement</a><br/>《中央社》<a href="https://www.cna.com.tw/news/acn/202610280100.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">姆巴佩被指「辱華」遭嚴厲抵制　許多中國人卻不知怎麼回事</a><br/>《路透社》<a href="https://www.reuters.com/business/media-telecom/mbappe-dropped-by-chinese-brands-over-alleged-mao-meme-comments-2026-10-27/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">Mbappe seeks to defuse anger in China after Mao &#39;dictator&#39; comment</a><br/>《美国之音》<a href="https://www.voachinese.com/a/soccer-star-kylian-mbappe-apologizes-after-chinese-brands-drop-him-over-remark-about-chinese-dictator-20261027/8215666.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">在多家中企宣布终止合作后，法国球星姆巴佩公开道歉 美国会委员会：他不应该道歉</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/CNwVIhiea32REYls1A_sxe8QyuuU1Oa_a0at9pv_V2lpJCQLPMy5PcRIoeo3r4IYGd_vXtC02JnzLK0y6ANn25xfewD3A_pNtE24QODgIuEL8irtsvk1_uUgtKoxg1tCf4xy5ttKV4ZIXRawW2WYXjErbfqr0O3obfsw-puhpdehpq13TXwkFAd2e7yuNn8_qIoxF5PeoxobL0wG5YibmaW-qhBPtp_criuG5-faR5RPvkNwTZJIJ1SHKov87a3yzTluhS7_rny_YZuRjJQNkTBQvkLvLQ6X3Jzak0Z7tgtXLcQXxKLyFuhLBjoEog-KVl0AfBG1_-z0Yv8OvUylSQ.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/ao0Z1ulkWgFswuEikxpWxyDYj7pB9bmQyNLkL9rq4UhNYUCwGbRx16uusH4O25Ybd57zY17KDWYO6GQ9P_IqmCMFE-8ptPd85cRpFAl6tyQUHXwfvzcl4IJlYcaFhzodP2e_ho3cmOBmsor1RrpTRlLqsFhtgeeS91Aq0nxpgsCUikBgMOt6uZxkjfJh-ktgiF3gs-9NSsVvERp4iWf5ZLIPw7qSBtwJSGA6kz_0Z5F-B3CjD8Ptqm1WYmd-_ggkCbyUP3bqsisTGGeazJcqqcmIdBrGFh7CcmlwusnPZtayLpx0aeZ2arP_AlSgsOesG93W73KDXMrTUwivo8CC6g.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/KZa17r092TLdep53wErg_B6ZPohNvk4hUUSs43iBaIG5iRwDp4xOjXfjDFk4MO1Xufiddpy8FY0syx_fppBIbYlDv8klliUFP4YA5On1EhqkT4o0R18GAjX95wuycRTgpn-vKCgoPYJ4yDsveyLPETaRzmQ7l4l2dtmSMgez6qa-x1OrHSosfMEBpmuV39xr3eTpHlH75k_hb7sYREllp3SBtAdeOfDlXBMHRfaGbyw2GjQ4QGyatYTLmhGD_LjDOqEAJSgmG_HSPrwmPNRcaNpHb0YEnGGyaTX_BVNGN0LzqqBcLpMpY8KGN44bToj_1wZhtAnzLrRRFP_kBJuyPg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/sbZOXo1eYEZCZCBkCpgw6L-imZB-hsC-xv_TC2T_w4AyX8_j