<item>
<title>曾两度曝光当地污染  环保志愿者遭跨省追捕  多篇相关文章遭删除曾两度曝光江西万载污染的环保志愿者张文斌，10月20日在</title>
<link>https://t.me/OutsightChina/10415</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/OutsightChina/10415</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 11:00:02 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"><b>曾两度曝光当地污染  环保志愿者遭跨省追捕  多篇相关文章遭删除</b><br/><br/>曾两度曝光江西万载污染的环保志愿者张文斌，10月20日在乌鲁木齐被江西万载警方跨省带走。据自媒体报道，其妹称家人在他失联三十多小时后才知去向。警方电话中称他涉敲诈勒索，“至少要在里面呆37天”。<br/><br/>自由亚洲致电万载县公安局，接听部门称“不属于我们管”。据自媒体报道，他写万载的文章无一处写到向企业要钱。<br/><br/>多篇相关自媒体文章遭删，万载警方至今未发通报，也未见中媒报道。环保前辈章志标称，张文斌曾说若被抓“肯定是遭到了打击报复”。家属授权自媒体替他“全网征婚”，其妹称他“特别想结婚”。<br/><br/><a href="?q=%23%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A">#社会</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83">#环境</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%B7%B2404">#已404</a> <a href="?q=%23%E6%B1%9F%E8%A5%BF">#江西</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%9C%8B%E9%89%B4">#看鉴</a><br/><br/><i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png')"><b>🔗</b></i>原文链接<br/>李宇琛<a href="https://chinadigitaltimes.net/chinese/733188.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">｜抓了环保志愿者，江西警方就能治好污染了？</a><br/>情况相当复杂  | <a href="https://chinadigitaltimes.net/chinese/733261.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">“张文斌早跟我说过，如果哪天被抓，肯定是打击报复”</a><br/>《自由亚洲电台》<a href="https://www.rfa.org/mandarin/zhengzhi/renquan/2026/10/22/china-environmental-activists-environmental-pollution-online-articles-zhang-wenbin/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">曾曝光污染 环保志愿者张文斌遭跨省抓捕</a><br/>情况相当复杂  | <a href="https://chinadigitaltimes.net/chinese/733213.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">家属授权全网征婚 / 为被跨省抓捕“至少在里面呆37天”的知名环保志愿者张文斌</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/PHG-DwOuPqk77LVwF8tcTgieje2gn1DYBWi7FOeIfzEEKiIlBR3rTyI_92M4JAfkrEB0qBkLj0ze17Ms_6mRcful4lQ0dk_K4ZqPiu8dWPDw5CJKjSbYnXzNTNzCKJ9TpIdAaCohr3P3NB3tV188dP8C83Ox0bOUPoeHVlf961ng3mCAfe9G5nZwGDGf3i6MJyZ1sw9pP_fz2GI6ok1CyZlXb_zMTHcHI9oUk2sbRvWcMO7WjxH_MS2W7TH7lvvJzlOJ0ZbjOcHyhnSR8PRMIFkNv1gx-JEwGhyhE9GZc6gk4yMOoy242WHv8NFcqmmUDUdPa2rMZKv4FSewIDZtUg.jpg" referre